-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Title: Runtime-index slot read vs print/compare agreement under pressure
-- Author: Matthew Schinkel, Copyright (c) 2026 all rights reserved.
-- Compiler: 3.0a1
--
-- Description:
--    The j50 pointers-tour stale-print shape: a declaration initializer
--    reading through a runtime-index slot, then print_byte_dec and an
--    equality compare of the SAME variable. The printed digits and the
--    compare must agree (the tour once printed 0 while the compare saw
--    the true value -- print-param home vs compare home divergence).
--    Allocation pressure mimics the tour (pads push the snap variable
--    out of the access bank). Validated through the TXREG byte log.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

